{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Summary:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Old school text RPG set in The Viking Age. There are three parts of the game.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong>\u00a0Live the immersive adventure, make choices and live with the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle:</strong>\u00a0Survive by any means necessary in the round based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Town:</strong>\u00a0Work, exercise, train combat skills, buy new items or enjoy your free time. It's up to you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Difficult choices:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You shall face many difficult choices. The outcome will often depend on your character - a clumsy strong warrior might have a hard time choosing a stealthy approach etc. Some results of your choices may have far reaching consequences while others could be completely irrelevant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Death:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sooner or later you'll probably die. The death is permanent, you'll have to start over. Don't worry though because for every death you earn points  based on your performance so your next character can become much stronger than his predecessors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Replayability:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed to be played multiple times. Feel free to experiment with various choices, experiencing different outcomes along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Demo:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unsure if this game is for you? Download the free demo version, experience the adventure first hand and decide for yourself!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552080?t=1741182836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552080?t=1741182836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/